Homepage: https://github.com/flux-framework/flux-pam
Package: flux-pam
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, flux-core
Description: PAM module for Flux
 flux-pam provides a PAM module that restricts node access to users
 with active Flux jobs and places their login sessions in the user's
 systemd slice, with prolog/housekeeping scripts that manage the slice
 and its resource constraints.
 Note: This package is meant for testing and may not meet Debian packaging
 standards.
